              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arai kisud ituŋanan aiyapo kaŋajepeke aswam aronis, arai aswam ajokis, ŋin naesudi ituŋanan einer kaiyaposit, komam ejeni; nakejenun, egwauni adiopet kaŋun: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
